.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH devin-migrate 1  "migrate " 
.SH NAME
devin\-migrate \- Migrate configuration from other tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin migrate\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Migrate configuration from other tools
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
devin\-migrate\-hooks(1)
Migrate Windsurf hooks (.windsurf/hooks.json) to Devin hooks (.devin/hooks.v1.json)
.TP
devin\-migrate\-workflows(1)
Migrate workflow files into skills and remove the originals
.TP
devin\-migrate\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
